        <mxCell id="BNg2NL_XmMpBTixDIjsQ-18" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt; Note :&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Computes the shard using the shard key (e.g., hash(userId)). Routes the request to the correct shard.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;The Primary of that shard performs the write.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;The Primary replicates the change to its replicas asynchronously.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
